 ny personal representatives\, may have against the SMC with respect to any
  bodily injury\, illness\, death\, medical treatment\, or property damage 
 that may arise from\, or in connection to\, any SMC program. This liabilit
 y waiver and release extends to the SMC along with Essex County and its st
 aff and any other affiliated organization or SMC partner. I also understan
 d that by signing below I approve the possible use of photos of me at this
