 FOR THIS HIKE I attest I am in good health and attest that I: Am not exper
 iencing any symptoms of illness such as cough\, shortness of breath or dif
 ficulty breathing\, fever\, chills\, repeated shaking with chills\, muscle
  pain\, headache\, sore throat\, or new loss of taste or smell.**\n**Am fo
 llowing all CDC recommended guidelines\, above\, and limiting my exposure 
 to the novel coronavirus/COVID-19.**\n\\# Arrival\\\, Weather\\\, & Cancel
