 ending on conditions\, and the size and pace of a group. If you have any q
 uestions\, call the leader. **Temperatures above 90 degrees and steady rai
 n cancels\, but intermittent drizzle does not. You will *not* be notified.
 ** **Bring water. Wear hiking boots\, preferably waterproof with good sole
 s and traction devices and bring poles (optional).** Dogs are not allowed 
